# Working notes kept local: these record real local paths and the names of
# specific maps in a personal collection, which do not belong in the repo.
# The files stay on disk - they are untracked, not deleted.
TODO.md
STATUS.md
notes/

# Developer tooling kept local: the benchmark harness, the corpus builder and
# the game-data refresher. They carry local install paths and the shape of a
# personal map corpus, and none of it is needed to use the package.
tools/

# Secrets and anything else that must never reach the repo: PyPI/anaconda
# tokens, signing keys, local credentials. Ignored before the directory was
# created, so nothing in it has ever been tracked.
private/
